// ⚠️  YE FILE DEPRECATED HAI — PLEASE USE prisma/schema/ FOLDER
// ============================================================
//
// Schema ab multiple files mein split ho gaya hai:
//
//  prisma/schema/
//  ├── base.prisma      ← datasource + generator (previewFeatures)
//  ├── enums.prisma     ← sare enum types
//  ├── auth.prisma      ← TenantRoute, Company, User, Session, AuditLog
//  ├── accounts.prisma  ← LedgerGroup, Ledger
//  ├── masters.prisma   ← Party, StockGroup, Unit, TaxRate, StockItem, CostCentre, Currency
//  ├── vouchers.prisma  ← FinancialYear, Voucher, VoucherLine, VoucherLineItem
//  └── banking.prisma   ← BankAccount, BankReconciliation
//
// Commands:
//   npm run prisma:generate   →  prisma generate --schema ./prisma/schema
//   npm run prisma:migrate    →  prisma migrate dev --schema ./prisma/schema
//   npm run prisma:studio     →  prisma studio --schema ./prisma/schema
//
// ============================================================
